Package: @NAME@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @AUTHOR@ <@EMAIL@>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: @WEBSITE@
Depends: obs-studio
Recommends: v4l2loopback-dkms, pulseaudio-utils
Description: @DISPLAY_NAME@ plugin for OBS Studio
 Use an iPhone or iPad running Moblin as a low latency camera in OBS Studio,
 over the USB cable. Also installs mobcam-virtualcam, which feeds the same
 camera into a v4l2loopback device and the audio into a PulseAudio, PipeWire or
 ALSA virtual microphone for every other program.
